    <name>
      <text>15.1 Solving quadratic using formula</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p></p><p>You would like to solve the quadratic equation \[{@eqn1@}\] using the quadratic formula: If \(ax^2+bx+c = 0\) then</p><p>\[x=\frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}\]</p><p>What is the value of \(a\), \(b\) and \(c\)?<br></p><p>\(a=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt1]]&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>\(b=\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt2]]&nbsp;</p><p>\(c=\)[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt3]]</p><p>What is the value of \(b^2-4ac\)?<br></p><p>[[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt4]]<br></p><p>What are the two solutions to the quadratic equation? You must give your answers as exact surds. Note that you can use e.g. sqrt(11) to type \( \sqrt{11} \)</p><p></p><p>\(x=\) [[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]] \(x=\)[[input:ans6]] [[validation:ans6]] [[feedback:prt5]]&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><br><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
